            and this is where its fill, border and specular highlight either hold up or vanish. Magnify to
            check the 1px details: the inset highlight along a control's top edge, the hairline border, and
            whether a selected state carries a border at all. Focus states only show under keyboard focus —
            see <a href="#focus">Focus rings</a>.
